{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:485a4537ae2a1f1a","name":"Gilder Varth","source":{"id":"source:reference-485a4537ae2a1f1a","title":"Gilder Varth","revision":21596,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:06:36Z","sha256":"a4d8f73076be9baf788ecdef3b56df4370447809260e90ef846a7e3f564514c4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21596","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gilder%20Varth&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-485a4537ae2a1f1a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Traitor's Gambit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Traitor%27s_Gambit","referenceId":"reference:b765bce19fabefc4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Admiral Varth is a slightly overweight man with close-cropped gray hair and a bushy mustache. He has clearly seen better days; his right eye is swollen and bruised, and a trail of dried blood stains the corner of his mouth.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the heroes manage to free Varth, he is grateful but confused as to the identity of his rescuers. He expected to be freed by Bail Organa's staff, not by hired freelancers. However, he is willing to accept whatever stories the heroes tell him as long as they promise to get him out of the facility. Varth is eager to take the ruse to the next stage and pass on so-called vital secrets that will lure Organa and his agents into a trap.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Admiral Varth is fairly guarded about the specifics of his imprisonment. Unsure of who the heroes are, he doesn't want to reveal too much, but he confirms that he is a former Imperial Admiral who has been funneling information to \"interested third parties\" for some time now. He says that he was captured a short while ago and is being held at the Felucian prison facility until the proper Imperial authorities can arrive to retrieve him.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Admiral Varth agrees to help the heroes escape from the facility, but he's not terribly interested in helping them fight. He can give them advice, but he is reluctant to pick up a blaster, even in his own defense. If pressed, he lends his aid, but in combat he usually provides the heroes with tactical assistance rather than shooting at anyone.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Gilder Varth Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, High Galactic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ref